            "content": "<ul><li>30 days or more before departure: full refund minus ₹2,500 per person.</li><li>15–29 days before departure: 50% of the package price is refunded.</li><li>Less than 15 days before departure: no refund.</li></ul><p>Flight tickets, visas and non-refundable hotel bookings are refunded according to the supplier’s rules.</p>"
